{"id": "34059", "title": "疼你！别躲我(欺瞒爱情2)", "author": "安琪", "category": "文学名著", "count": 49, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34059.htm", "intro": "天生一股傻劲的贝晓雨，常常说话得罪人而不自知；坏心的教授设计她离乡背井到香港当狗仔，她也傻得去了！不过天公疼憨人，原本虐待她的老板竟被她的“傻”感动，还派给她大任务──采访神秘兮兮的地产大亨接班人！幸好她有“门路”，顺利得到了“他”真正的落脚处──可是……眼前明明很眼熟的男子，却说自己不是“他”?! 香港地产大王的独生子饶子炆，其实是个双面人；白天是成熟稳重的贵公子，晚上则变成颓废不羁的浪子。他就是喜欢玩游戏搞神秘，分身三个都不嫌多！但是那个菜鸟女狗仔，到底是记者还是马戏团艺人？ 嗯……看来可以好好利用她，继续大玩他的“神秘游戏”", "base": "files/article/html/34/34059", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2165652.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2165653.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2165654.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2165655.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2165656.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2165657.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2165658.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2165659.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2165660.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2165661.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2165662.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2165663.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2165664.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2165665.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2165666.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2165667.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2165668.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2165669.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2165670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2165671.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2165672.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2165673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2165674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2165675.html", "avai